The grace-period borrower carries the full principal for 3 years, then has to pay it down faster. The dashed line is flat from month 0 to month 36, then descends more steeply than its solid counterpart.

The pipe |&gt; — chaining operations
Without a pipe:

arrange(filter(mutate(data, z = x + y), z &gt; 6), desc(z))

With a pipe:

data |&gt;
  mutate(z = x + y) |&gt;
  filter(z &gt; 6) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(z))

Read left-to-right, top-to-bottom — the way you actually think.

